{"ref":"BDB, רָפֶה","hw":"רָפֶה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָפֶה</span></big>  <strong>adj. slack</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>, of people, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:18\" href=\"/Numbers.13.18\">Nu 13:18</a> (J); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְפֵה יָדַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.2\">2 S 17:2</a>, i.e. weak (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגֵעַ</span>); fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָדַיִם רָפוֹת</span> fig. of discouragement and fear <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.3\">Is 35:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 4:3\" href=\"/Job.4.3\">Jb 4:3</a>. cf. √ <strong>Qal. 2</strong>.","next":"BDB, רִפָּיוֹן","prev":"BDB, רָפָה²"}